%% Sequence Diagram: Youth Account API (OAuth, RBAC, Audit Logging)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant UI as Parent Portal UI
    participant API as Youth Account API
    participant Account as Account Service
    participant Payment as Payment Service
    participant Transaction as Transaction Service
    participant DB as Youth Account DB
    note over Parent,UI: Parent logs in (OAuth2)
    Parent->>UI: Authenticate (OAuth2)
    UI->>API: OAuth2 token in Authorization header
    note over API: RBAC enforced per request
    rect rgb(230,230,250)
      Parent->>UI: View Dashboard
      UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard
      API->>Account: Fetch account info
      API->>Transaction: Fetch recent transactions
      API->>DB: Fetch spending limit
      API-->>UI: Dashboard data
      UI-->>Parent: Render dashboard
    end
    rect rgb(220,255,220)
      Parent->>UI: Transfer Funds
      UI->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer
      API->>Payment: Initiate fund transfer
      API->>Account: Update balances
      API->>DB: Update account record
      API-->>UI: Transfer result
      UI-->>Parent: Show transfer confirmation
    end
    rect rgb(255,255,220)
      Parent->>UI: Set Spending Limit
      UI->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit
      API->>DB: Update spending limit
      API-->>UI: Limit updated
      UI-->>Parent: Show confirmation
    end
    rect rgb(255,220,220)
      Parent->>UI: View Transactions
      UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions
      API->>Transaction: Fetch transactions
      API-->>UI: Transactions list
      UI-->>Parent: Show transactions
    end
    note over API: Audit log every action
